rofreak/UI/Front/Row/01 Top/01 Matrix/Button/Assn/3) is the \"move\" destination",["18:17 Enter Microfreak/Preset/260 8bitfi","21:04 Low helicopter","My Notes"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-9979","21:45 - using some pitch bends to destroy the blanket",["18:17 Enter Microfreak/Preset/260 8bitfi","21:04 Low helicopter","My Notes"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-10040","Spoken Words from Person/codekiln",["Chapters","18:17 Enter Microfreak/Preset/260 8bitfi","21:04 Low helicopter"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-10107","21:28 — I'm seeing that under Assign 3, there's the move destination. I don't know what that is. Let's try messing with it. It's under the key ARP. Huh. Okay, key ARP, Assign 3. Huh. Move destination. What could that possibly mean?",["18:17 Enter Microfreak/Preset/260 8bitfi","21:04 Low helicopter","Spoken Words from Person/codekiln"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-10348","22:12 High notes and pitch bends",["Infini Pad bass and 8bitfi","Chapters","18:17 Enter Microfreak/Preset/260 8bitfi"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-10391","Notes from GitP/Acolyte",["Chapters","18:17 Enter Microfreak/Preset/260 8bitfi","22:12 High notes and pitch bends"]],["GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun/","source-block-10425","Notes between A♭4 and B♭5 return, then Microfreak/UG/11 Icon Strip/03 Touch Strip/02 Bend stretch across the full range.",["18:17 Enter Microfreak/Preset/260 8bitfi","22:12 High notes and pitch bends","Notes from GitP/Acolyte"]]],"format_version":5}